  "description": "【Foldable and Step-thru Desigh】The electric tricycle for adults is made from 6061 aluminum alloy, making it both light and extremely durable. Its unique step-through and folding frame is easy to lift your leg over the etrikes. The stepover to floor height is 14”, more inclusive of users, friendly for women, the elderly and people with knee problems for ride.\n【Power System】 The 500W motor can provide the e-tricycle with up to 15MPH speed and 80N.m torque, make it go over 30° high slope, conquer most road conditions. Combined with the 48V 14Ah Samsung cells lithium battery, which provides you a maximum cruising range of 35 miles in pure electric mode and 55 miles in pedal-assisted mode.\n【Comfortable Riding】 The tricycle is designed with the road challenges of commuting and long-distance travel in mind. Equipped with multiple shock absorbs, MOZO lockable hydraulic suspension front forks and seatpost suspension, allowing the rider to be fully cushioned on bumpy roads. With Kenda 20 x 4-inch fat tires, it can traverse all sorts of terrain, including mountains, snow, beach, rocky roads, and even urban jungles.\n【Safer Riding】 This electric tricycle featured ZOOM hydraulic disc brakes system, enables the etrike to stop quickly and smoothly when riding at high speed without squeaky noise, shortening the braking distance even on a wet road. The clever rear differential provide the superior stability and confidence in the corners.\n【Assembly& Warranty】 Installation video and assembly manual provide. All tools included in box. Each tricycle comes with a 1-year warranty on major components. If there has any problem, don't hesitate to contact us, we will reply to you within 24 hours.",
